      "flags": {},
      "order": 2,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "START HERE — Clip 1 / FFLF workflow",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# H3 Infinite — Start Workflow\n\nUse this workflow to create the **first clip** of a continuation chain.\n\n1. Select the H3 model, Qwen encoder, Video VAE and Audio VAE.\n2. Load a **First Frame** and **Last Frame**. Optionally load a Qwen reference image (`<Picture 1>`).\n3. Enter the action/dialogue prompt and desired **Duration (Seconds)** in **H3 Infinite - Start FFLF v1.2**.\n4. Queue the workflow. The clip is decoded, analyzed for its end freeze, and the full AV latent plus handover metadata is saved.\n5. Use the **Continuation workflow** for Clip 2+. It loads this latent and continues motion + native audio directly.\n\n`Full` keeps the complete rendered clip. `Stitch Ready` trims the unusable tail for an intermediate segment. `Final Clip` is intended for the last continuation segment and keeps its complete landing.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# H3 Infinite — Start Workflow\n\nUse this workflow to create the **first clip** of a continuation chain.\n\n1. Select the H3 model, Qwen encoder, Video VAE and Audio VAE.\n2. Load a **First Frame** and **Last Frame**. Optionally load a Qwen reference image (`<Picture 1>`).\n3. Enter the action/dialogue prompt and desired **Duration (Seconds)** in **H3 Infinite - Start FFLF v1.2**.\n4. Queue the workflow. The clip is decoded, analyzed for its end freeze, and the full AV latent plus handover metadata is saved.\n5. Use the **Continuation workflow** for Clip 2+. It loads this latent and continues motion + native audio directly.\n\n`Full` keeps the complete rendered clip. `Stitch Ready` trims the unusable tail for an intermediate segment. `Final Clip` is intended for the last continuation segment and keeps its complete landing.\n"
      },
      "color": "#1f4d3b",
      "bgcolor": "#2c6b52"
    },
