      "title": "INFO — Models & optimization",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Model setup\n- **H3 FL2VA Diffusion Model:** the video diffusion model.\n- **Qwen3-VL H3 Encoder:** encodes prompt + optional `<Picture 1>`.\n- **Video / Audio VAE:** decode H3's two latent streams.\n- **SageAttention:** optional speed/memory optimization used by this example.\n\nKeep the same model/VAE setup for every clip in one chain.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "### Model setup\n- **H3 FL2VA Diffusion Model:** the video diffusion model.\n- **Qwen3-VL H3 Encoder:** encodes prompt + optional `<Picture 1>`.\n- **Video / Audio VAE:** decode H3's two latent streams.\n- **SageAttention:** optional speed/memory optimization used by this example.\n\nKeep the same model/VAE setup for every clip in one chain.\n"
      },
      "color": "#3f3f3f",
      "bgcolor": "#575757"
    },
