      "title": "INFO — First / Last / Reference images",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Image inputs\n**First Frame** is the exact visual start anchor of Clip 1.  \n**Last Frame** is the target end anchor H3 should converge toward.  \n**Reference Image** is optional and is passed to Qwen as `<Picture 1>` for identity/style guidance; it is not inserted as a persistent DiT reference latent.\n\nFor reliable continuation, pre-generate the desired Last Frame for each clip and keep resolution/aspect ratio consistent.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "### Image inputs\n**First Frame** is the exact visual start anchor of Clip 1.  \n**Last Frame** is the target end anchor H3 should converge toward.  \n**Reference Image** is optional and is passed to Qwen as `<Picture 1>` for identity/style guidance; it is not inserted as a persistent DiT reference latent.\n\nFor reliable continuation, pre-generate the desired Last Frame for each clip and keep resolution/aspect ratio consistent.\n"
      },
      "color": "#3f3f3f",
      "bgcolor": "#575757"
    },
