      "title": "INFO — Start conditioning",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### H3 Infinite - Start FFLF v1.2\n- **Prompt:** overall action, dialogue, camera motion and audio intent.\n- **Width / Height:** generation resolution. Keep it constant across the chain.\n- **Duration:** requested seconds; H3 snaps internally to its valid temporal grid.\n- **ref_image_size:** `match` is the recommended normal setting.\n\nThe node creates native H3 first/last-frame conditioning and the empty AV latent used by the sampler.\n\n\n**Prompting tip:** describe the action as continuing through the segment (for example `she continues walking`) rather than strongly instructing the model to settle into the Last Frame. Keep important dialogue away from the very end of a segment, where trimming may occur.\n\nIf unwanted background music is a problem, try appending `non_diegetic_music: N/A`. When using `<Picture 1>` for identity, explicitly describe it as the reference for the subject's facial features, clothing and body composition."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "### H3 Infinite - Start FFLF v1.2\n- **Prompt:** overall action, dialogue, camera motion and audio intent.\n- **Width / Height:** generation resolution. Keep it constant across the chain.\n- **Duration:** requested seconds; H3 snaps internally to its valid temporal grid.\n- **ref_image_size:** `match` is the recommended normal setting.\n\nThe node creates native H3 first/last-frame conditioning and the empty AV latent used by the sampler.\n\n\n**Prompting tip:** describe the action as continuing through the segment (for example `she continues walking`) rather than strongly instructing the model to settle into the Last Frame. Keep important dialogue away from the very end of a segment, where trimming may occur.\n\nIf unwanted background music is a problem, try appending `non_diegetic_music: N/A`. When using `<Picture 1>` for identity, explicitly describe it as the reference for the subject's facial features, clothing and body composition."
      },
      "color": "#3f3f3f",
      "bgcolor": "#575757"
    },
