      "title": "INFO — Sampling settings",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Sampling\nThe example uses **Sigma Shift 12 / 3**, `res_multistep`, **15 steps**, and a random seed.\n\nThese are normal H3 sampling controls, not continuation-specific. Change them if your H3 setup requires different values. For consistent behavior, use the same sampling setup for all clips in the chain.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "### Sampling\nThe example uses **Sigma Shift 12 / 3**, `res_multistep`, **15 steps**, and a random seed.\n\nThese are normal H3 sampling controls, not continuation-specific. Change them if your H3 setup requires different values. For consistent behavior, use the same sampling setup for all clips in the chain.\n"
