      "title": "INFO — Auto Handover",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Auto Handover\n`Balanced` is the validated default. The node analyzes the decoded tail and stores the **effective phase-aligned handover cutoff**.\n\nIf no freeze is detected, the v1.2 no-lock fallback still excludes the final `freeze_hold - 1` frames before selecting a valid H3 latent boundary.\n\nUse **Motion Safe** when you prefer an earlier/more conservative handover. Choose **Custom** only when tuning the detector manually.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "### Auto Handover\n`Balanced` is the validated default. The node analyzes the decoded tail and stores the **effective phase-aligned handover cutoff**.\n\nIf no freeze is detected, the v1.2 no-lock fallback still excludes the final `freeze_hold - 1` frames before selecting a valid H3 latent boundary.\n\nUse **Motion Safe** when you prefer an earlier/more conservative handover. Choose **Custom** only when tuning the detector manually.\n"
      },
      "color": "#3f3f3f",
      "bgcolor": "#575757"
    },
